<text top="1239" left="549" width="279" height="18" font="8"><i><b> [Differentiated Activity (*) on p. 86] </b></i></text>
<text top="1236" left="117" width="441" height="22" font="10"><i>Kostas enjoys reading a sports magazine that contains a pen pal </i></text>
<text top="1236" left="117" width="441" height="22" font="10"><i>section. He would like to reply to a boy’s letter from Sweden but </i></text>
<text top="1236" left="117" width="443" height="22" font="10"><i>he has trouble putting some of the verbs into the right tense.  </i></text>
<text top="1236" left="117" width="126" height="22" font="10"><i>Can you help him?</i></text>
<text top="1237" left="129" width="83" height="20" font="18"><i>Dear Peter,</i></text>
<text top="1237" left="129" width="429" height="20" font="18"><i>Hello!  My name is Kostas. I (1) saw / see / shall see your </i></text>
<text top="1237" left="129" width="431" height="20" font="18"><i>letter asking for a pen pal in this month’s Soccer Club </i></text>
<text top="1237" left="129" width="73" height="20" font="18"><i>magazine.</i></text>
<text top="1237" left="129" width="430" height="20" font="18"><i>I (2) lived / live / will live in Athens with my parents and </i></text>
<text top="1237" left="129" width="674" height="20" font="18"><i>my younger sister. I (3) was / am / will be 11 years old and I (4) go / went / will go to </i></text>
<text top="1237" left="129" width="563" height="20" font="18"><i>primary school. I also (5) will play / played / play football with my friends.</i></text>
<text top="1237" left="129" width="673" height="20" font="18"><i>I never (6) liked / like / will like football when I was at nursery school. I (7) changed / will </i></text>
<text top="1237" left="129" width="674" height="20" font="18"><i>change / change my mind when my father (8) will take / takes / took me to a football </i></text>
<text top="1237" left="129" width="674" height="20" font="18"><i>match.  It (9) was / is / will be really exciting!  The players (10) will run / were running / </i></text>
<text top="1237" left="129" width="673" height="20" font="18"><i>are running up and down and we (11) were shouting / are shouting / will shout.   One day </i></text>
<text top="1237" left="129" width="508" height="20" font="18"><i>(12) I am / was / will be a famous footballer, I think! Best wishes,</i></text>
<text top="1237" left="542" width="56" height="20" font="18"><i>Kostas</i></text>
<text top="1235" left="423" width="89" height="22" font="19"><b>LESSON 2</b></text>
<text top="1235" left="117" width="22" height="20" font="2">M </text>
