<text top="1239" left="117" width="240" height="18" font="8"><i><b>[Differentiated Activity (*) on p. 87] </b></i></text>
<text top="1236" left="117" width="246" height="22" font="10"><i>This is a famous painting by Pablo </i></text>
<text top="1236" left="117" width="241" height="22" font="10"><i>Picasso. It is called Guernica, the </i></text>
<text top="1236" left="117" width="231" height="22" font="10"><i>name of a Spanish town.  Write </i></text>
<text top="1236" left="117" width="261" height="22" font="10"><i>sentences to describe what you see. </i></text>
